WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.230 --> 00:00:03.170
- My name is Ella, and I love pranks.

00:00:03.170 --> 00:00:06.020
I one time pranked my boss at work

00:00:06.020 --> 00:00:08.861
by putting baby goats in his office.

00:00:08.861 --> 00:00:09.694
(goat crying)

00:00:09.694 --> 00:00:10.940
So let me tell you the story

00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:14.880
of the time I pranked my
family with an emu egg.

00:00:16.854 --> 00:00:19.050
(laughing)

00:00:19.050 --> 00:00:21.160
So, my friend at work, Sara Rubin,

00:00:21.160 --> 00:00:23.310
ordered a bunch of emu eggs.

00:00:23.310 --> 00:00:25.460
I think she was filming a video

00:00:25.460 --> 00:00:28.740
where she had people make
omelets out of emu eggs.

00:00:28.740 --> 00:00:31.170
She asks me if I want to keep one,

00:00:31.170 --> 00:00:32.990
and I say, yeah, definitely.

00:00:32.990 --> 00:00:34.620
Like, I'm gonna figure
out what to do with it.

00:00:34.620 --> 00:00:37.060
I have this emu egg.

00:00:37.060 --> 00:00:39.910
My parents have a chicken coop.

00:00:39.910 --> 00:00:42.310
I'm gonna put this emu egg in the coop

00:00:42.310 --> 00:00:44.520
where the chickens lay the eggs,

00:00:44.520 --> 00:00:46.110
and I'm gonna see what their reaction is.

00:00:46.110 --> 00:00:49.410
This footage was actually
captured two years ago,

00:00:49.410 --> 00:00:51.690
but I hadn't done anything with it yet,

00:00:51.690 --> 00:00:53.780
and I decided, now is the time.

00:00:53.780 --> 00:00:56.060
So they have this coop, they
have these two chickens,

00:00:56.060 --> 00:00:57.150
the chickens are cute.

00:00:57.150 --> 00:01:01.200
I don't live there, but I
thought, how funny would it be

00:01:01.200 --> 00:01:04.450
if I put this egg inside of their coop

00:01:04.450 --> 00:01:06.680
and made it seem like
the chicken laid the egg?

00:01:06.680 --> 00:01:08.430
- [Luka] Ugh, flip flops.

00:01:14.130 --> 00:01:16.880
- So my mom is really gullible,

00:01:16.880 --> 00:01:21.880
and my dad is just a
Brazilian, aloof kind of guy.

00:01:23.300 --> 00:01:25.280
Like, it's pretty easy to trick them.

00:01:28.600 --> 00:01:29.433
- [Mother] Oh my God!

00:01:29.433 --> 00:01:32.830
- We were filming secretly, I
had the camera in my pocket.

00:01:32.830 --> 00:01:34.592
- [Mother] What is that?

00:01:34.592 --> 00:01:36.983
(mumbles) put that there or something.

00:01:36.983 --> 00:01:38.468
Dear God.

00:01:38.468 --> 00:01:40.051
- [Luka] Oh my God.

00:01:42.930 --> 00:01:43.815
- [Father] What?

00:01:43.815 --> 00:01:44.982
- [Ella] What?

00:01:46.530 --> 00:01:50.780
- My mom is a religious
Mexican-American woman,

00:01:50.780 --> 00:01:52.440
and she was not having it.

00:01:52.440 --> 00:01:54.690
She was like, this is some devil (bleep).

00:01:54.690 --> 00:01:57.360
Like, what happened?

00:01:59.810 --> 00:02:01.200
- That's a real egg.

00:02:02.380 --> 00:02:06.480
Oh my God, it's like a super chicken.

00:02:06.480 --> 00:02:10.500
If those little chickens can
lay these eggs, we are rich.

00:02:11.600 --> 00:02:12.820
There's something inside.

00:02:12.820 --> 00:02:14.680
- [Luka] No, stop, bring it inside.

00:02:16.036 --> 00:02:18.119
- [Ella] Bring it inside.

00:02:22.490 --> 00:02:24.070
- This might be out of space.

00:02:25.633 --> 00:02:27.670
It has to do with a meteor.

00:02:27.670 --> 00:02:28.900
- [Mother] It's scaring me.

00:02:28.900 --> 00:02:30.540
- [Ella] Just touch it.

00:02:30.540 --> 00:02:31.698
- [Father] Shake it.

00:02:31.698 --> 00:02:32.698
It's like a.

