- [Luka] Do you think we're going

00:02:37.453 --> 00:02:38.580
to make money off these chickens?

00:02:38.580 --> 00:02:40.330
- If they lay eggs like this,

00:02:40.330 --> 00:02:42.470
we can have a thousand
chickens that'll worth 'em.

00:02:42.470 --> 00:02:43.780
- [Mother] No, come on.

00:02:43.780 --> 00:02:46.150
- [Ella] I want Mom to crack it.

00:02:46.150 --> 00:02:47.362
- I don't like this.

00:02:47.362 --> 00:02:48.712
- [Ella] I want to see what's inside.

00:02:48.712 --> 00:02:50.074
- It doesn't crack.

00:02:50.074 --> 00:02:54.168
- [Ella] You have to do
it hard, I don't know.

00:02:54.168 --> 00:02:55.442
- [Ella] I want to see what's inside.

00:02:55.442 --> 00:02:56.275
Crack it.

00:02:59.784 --> 00:03:02.680
- Crack it hard.
- Crack it.

00:03:02.680 --> 00:03:05.421
- [Luka] Don't spill it out please.

00:03:05.421 --> 00:03:06.890
- [Luka] I need to see
what's in there, now.

00:03:06.890 --> 00:03:08.480
You gotta just get dirty, Mom.

00:03:08.480 --> 00:03:09.380
- Just a minute, just a minute,

00:03:09.380 --> 00:03:11.413
because I'm really, God,

00:03:11.413 --> 00:03:13.171
this is, like, really bad.

00:03:13.171 --> 00:03:14.004
(screams)

00:03:14.004 --> 00:03:14.837
Oh my God!

00:03:14.837 --> 00:03:16.670
