00:03:18.384 --> 00:03:19.217
Jesus Christ.

00:03:19.217 --> 00:03:21.994
- [Ella] Crack it open, I want to see.

00:03:21.994 --> 00:03:23.944
I want to see.

00:03:23.944 --> 00:03:25.434
Crack it open.

00:03:25.434 --> 00:03:26.453
(screams)

00:03:26.453 --> 00:03:27.792
