00:03:43.234 --> 00:03:44.234
- Oh my God.

00:03:50.211 --> 00:03:51.128
- You did this.

00:03:51.128 --> 00:03:53.030
- [Luka] We pranked ya!

00:03:53.030 --> 00:03:54.250
- She was mad at me.

00:03:54.250 --> 00:03:55.400
